    "fields": {
      "title": "Quantale-enriched model of tasks and the contract-embedding sheaf",
      "sponsors_projects_dates": "DARPA SEAMAN (Aug 2025 – present)",
      "description": "A formal language in which the tasks an autonomous agent can be assigned are objects of a category enriched in a quantale, so that \"how well does this task match that one\" is a graded quantity rather than a yes/no test. This is the specification the software at [[ref:lawvere]] implements.",
